@@ -3,3 +3,17 @@
 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+## Features
+
+### JSON Pointer (RFC 6901)
+
+`resolvePointer(document, pointer)` resolves a [JSON Pointer](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6901)
+against a JSON document and returns the value it refers to. It throws a `JsonPointerError` when the
+pointer is not syntactically valid, or when it does not resolve to a value of the document.
+
+```ts
+import { resolvePointer } from 'json-toolkit';
+
+resolvePointer({ foo: ['bar', 'baz'] }, '/foo/0'); // => 'bar'
+```
